# Deploy habit (WL Sales)

After any project edits:

1. `git commit` + `git push origin` (current branch). Never force-push `main`/`master`. Do not commit secrets (`config.php`, `.env`, tokens, passwords).
2. In the final reply always include **ready-to-run VPS commands** to apply the update on the live server.

Default deploy path: `/ssd/www/wlsales` (repo root; DocumentRoot is `public/`).

Standard apply block (adapt if path/branch differs):

```bash
cd /ssd/www/wlsales
git pull origin main
# if SQL migrations were added in this change:
# mysql -u root -p wlsales < sql/00X_....sql
sudo systemctl reload php8.2-fpm
# optional: clear opcache / restart apache if needed
# sudo systemctl reload apache2
```

Mention any new admin URLs or `.env` keys that need filling after pull.
